e terminal mannose moiety in the core structure of the nascent N-linked glycan chain, giving rise to the second branch in complex glycans."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}